flowchart TD
    Start([Division Legal Officer Registers Case]) --> CheckAuth{Is Authenticated & Div User?}
    CheckAuth -- No --> Deny[Return HTTP 403 / Redirect Login]
    CheckAuth -- Yes --> InputForm[Fill MVC Registration Form<br/>Case No, Court, Accident Date, Vehicle No, Depot]

    InputForm --> Validate[Server-side Model Validation]
    Validate -- Invalid --> ReturnForm[Re-render with Validation Summary]
    Validate -- Valid --> InsertCase[Insert into MVC_CASES & MVC_PETITIONER_DETAILS<br/>Status = 'Pending']

    InsertCase --> CaseActive{Case Active in MACT Tribunal}
    
    CaseActive --> RecordHearing[Post Hearing Proceedings / Next Date<br/>POST /Case/SaveHearing -> Insert MVC_CASE_HEARING_DETAILS]
    RecordHearing --> CaseActive

    CaseActive --> NAPIXSync[Trigger e-Courts NAPIX Sync<br/>POST /ECourts/QueueCaseSync<br/>Priority 1 Queue Entry]
    NAPIXSync --> FetchOrders[Fetch Next Hearing & Interim Orders via NIC Gateway]
    FetchOrders --> CaseActive

    CaseActive --> FinalAward[MACT Tribunal Issues Final Award]
    FinalAward --> RecordAward[POST /Case/SaveAdverseDetails<br/>Award Amount, Liability %, Interest Rate, Feasibility]

    RecordAward --> FeasibilityCheck{Is Corporation Appeal Feasible?}
    FeasibilityCheck -- Yes --> FileMFA[File High Court Appeal / MFA<br/>POST /Appeal/Save -> Insert APPEAL_DETAILS]
    FileMFA --> HCProceedings[Track High Court Hearing & Stay Orders]
    HCProceedings --> HCAward[High Court Modifies / Dismisses Award]

    FeasibilityCheck -- No --> SettleAward[Accept Tribunal Award Liability]

    SettleAward --> EPFiled{Does Claimant File EP?}
    HCAward --> EPFiled
    
    EPFiled -- Yes --> HandleEP[Register Execution Petition<br/>POST /EP/Create -> Insert EP_DETAILS<br/>Track Court Deposits & Attachment Warrants]
    HandleEP --> EPDisburse[Disburse Claimants via Court Challans]
    
    EPFiled -- No --> DirectPayment[Direct Compensation Disbursement]

    DirectPayment --> FinancialBilling[Submit Advocate Fees & Expenses<br/>POST /Report/SavePettyBill -> Insert PETTY_BILL_PAYMENTS]
    EPDisburse --> FinancialBilling

    FinancialBilling --> AuditCheck[Automatic Duplicate Bill Detection<br/>NyayaPathaPettyBillRAG & Previous Payment Checks]
    AuditCheck --> PrintBill[Generate Official Form & Payment Advice<br/>GET /Report/PrintBill/{id}]

    PrintBill --> CaseClosed([Case Status Marked 'Disposed' / Closed in MVC_CASES])
